<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates down.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates down.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell on Wednesday in a moderate market to a range of 9-3/4 and 10-1/4 percent from Tuesday's range of 10-1/4 and 10-5/16, private sector bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also fell to 10 and 10-1/4 percent from 10-3/8 and 10-1/2 percent on Tuesday, they said.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rates at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
